("Foreground-Aware Relation Network for Geospatial Object Segmentation",
CVPR 2020; FarSeg++ in IEEE TPAMI)

The upstream repository is licensed Apache-2.0 (GitHub license badge +
LICENSE file in the upstream repo).

A full copy of the Apache License, Version 2.0 shipped with this
distribution is in `Apache-2.0.LICENSE` (and applies to the
